<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>🦾 Pattern AI v15.0</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); color: #fff; padding: 15px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 100vh; }
h1 { text-align: center; color: #00d2ff; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 5px; text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,210,255,0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.version-badge { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; }
.api-settings { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,210,255,0.3); }
.api-settings h4 { color: #00d2ff; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.api-input-group { margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.api-input-group label { font-size: 18px; min-width: 24px; text-align: center; }
.api-input-group input, .api-input-group select { flex: 1; padding: 8px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid #00d2ff; border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; }
.api-input-group input:focus, .api-input-group select:focus { outline: none; border-color: #00d2ff; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,210,255,0.3); }
.api-status { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 5px; margin-left: 34px; }
.api-status.connected { color: #4CAF50; }
.api-status.disconnected { color: #F44336; }
.api-status.loading { color: #ff9800; }
.proxy-presets { display: flex; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 5px; margin-left: 34px; }
.proxy-preset { padding: 4px 8px; background: rgba(0,210,255,0.1); border: 1px solid #00d2ff; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10px; color: #00d2ff; cursor: pointer; }
.proxy-preset:hover { background: rgba(0,210,255,0.3); }
.mode-switch { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.mode-btn { flex: 1; padding: 14px; border: 2px solid #00d2ff; background: transparent; color: #00d2ff; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 14px; }
.mode-btn.active { background: #00d2ff; color: #000; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,210,255,0.5); }
.domain-badge { text-align: center; padding: 10px; background: rgba(0,210,255,0.1); border: 1px solid #00d2ff; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; }
.query-box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,210,255,0.3); }
.query-box textarea { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid #00d2ff; border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; }
.query-box textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: #00d2ff; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,210,255,0.3); }
.char-counter { text-align: right; font-size: 11px; color: #888; margin-top: 6px; }
.btn { width: 100%; padding: 14px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 10px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #fff; transition: all 0.3s; }
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
.btn-green { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4CAF50 0%, #45a049 100%); }
.btn-blue { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d2ff 0%, #0099cc 100%); color: #000; }
.btn-purple { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9c27b0 0%, #7b1fa2 100%); }
.btn-orange { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9800 0%, #f57c00 100%); color: #000; }
.btn-small { padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12px; width: auto; margin-top: 5px; }
.examples { margin-top: 15px; padding: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border-radius: 8px; }
.examples h4 { color: #888; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.example-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0,210,255,0.15); border: 1px solid #00d2ff; border-radius: 6px; color: #00d2ff; font-size: 11px; margin: 3px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
.example-btn:hover { background: rgba(0,210,255,0.3); transform: scale(1.05); }
.example-btn.real { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.15); border-color: #4CAF50; color: #4CAF50; }
.example-btn.fake { background: rgba(244,67,54,0.15); border-color: #F44336; color: #F44336; }
.example-btn.security { background: rgba(255,152,0,0.15); border-color: #ff9800; color: #ff9800; }
.result { margin-top: 25px; padding: 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; display: none; border: 1px solid rgba(0,210,255,0.3); }
.score { text-align: center; font-size: 64px; font-weight: bold; color: #00d2ff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.score.good { color: #4CAF50; }
.score.penalty { color: #F44336; }
.archetype { background: rgba(0,210,255,0.1); border: 1px solid #00d2ff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; text-align: center; }
.archetype-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #00d2ff; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.status { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; min-height: 20px; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; }
.warning-box, .contradiction-box, .fluff-box, .llm-analysis-box, .wiki-box, .memory-box, .meta-patterns-box, .debate-box, .debug-box, .questions-box, .concreteness-box { padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 15px 0; display: none; }
.warning-box { background: rgba(244,67,54,0.1); border: 2px solid #F44336; }
.warning-box h3 { color: #F44336; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.contradiction-box { background: rgba(255,152,0,0.1); border: 2px solid #ff9800; }
.contradiction-box h3 { color: #ff9800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.fluff-box { background: rgba(156,39,176,0.1); border: 2px solid #9c27b0; }
.fluff-box h3 { color: #ce93d8; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.concreteness-box { background: rgba(33,150,243,0.1); border: 2px solid #2196F3; }
.concreteness-box h4 { color: #64B5F6; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
.llm-analysis-box { background: rgba(156,39,176,0.08); border: 1px solid #9c27b0; }
.llm-analysis-box h4 { color: #ce93d8; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.wiki-box { background: rgba(33,150,243,0.1); border: 1px solid #2196F3; }
.wiki-box h4 { color: #64B5F6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.memory-box { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.1); border: 1px solid #4CAF50; }
.memory-box h4 { color: #81C784; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.meta-patterns-box { background: rgba(255,87,34,0.1); border: 2px solid #FF5722; }
.meta-patterns-box h4 { color: #FF8A65; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
.debate-box { background: rgba(0,150,136,0.1); border: 2px solid #009688; }
.debate-box h4 { color: #4DB6AC; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
.questions-box { background: rgba(156,39,176,0.1); border: 2px solid #9c27b0; }
.questions-box h4 { color: #ce93d8; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
.debug-box { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 2px solid #FF5722; }
.debug-box h4 { color: #FF5722; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; }
.debug-log { font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #ccc; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; max-height: 300px; overflow-y: auto; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; }
.debug-log .error { color: #F44336; }
.debug-log .success { color: #4CAF50; }
.debug-log .warning { color: #ff9800; }
.debug-log .info { color: #00d2ff; }
.debate-argument { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #009688; }
.debate-argument.pro { border-left-color: #4CAF50; }
.debate-argument.con { border-left-color: #F44336; }
.debate-label { font-size: 11px; color: #888; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.debate-text { font-size: 13px; color: #fff; }
.question-item, .concreteness-item { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #2196F3; }
.question-item { border-left-color: #9c27b0; }
.question-number { font-weight: bold; color: #9c27b0; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 14px; }
.question-text, .concreteness-text { color: #fff; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
.question-target { color: #888; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 5px; font-style: italic; }
.llm-section, .wiki-section, .memory-section, .meta-pattern-item { margin: 8px 0; }
.llm-label, .wiki-label, .memory-label { color: #888; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.llm-value, .wiki-value, .memory-value { color: #fff; margin-top: 4px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }
.meta-pattern-item { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #FF5722; }
.meta-pattern-name { font-weight: bold; color: #FF8A65; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.meta-pattern-desc { color: #ccc; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.meta-pattern-rec { color: #4CAF50; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; }
.meta-severity-critical { border-left-color: #F44336; }
.meta-severity-warning { border-left-color: #FF9800; }
.metrics-box { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.1); border: 1px solid #4CAF50; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; font-size: 12px; }
.metrics-box div { margin: 4px 0; }
.llm-badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(156,39,176,0.2); border: 1px solid #9c27b0; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; color: #ce93d8; margin-left: 8px; }
.llm-badge.offline { background: rgba(255,152,0,0.2); border-color: #ff9800; color: #ff9800; }
.loading-overlay { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 1000; }
.loading-overlay.active { display: flex; }
.loading-content { background: #1a1a2e; border: 2px solid #00d2ff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; max-width: 300px; }
.loading-spinner { width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 4px solid rgba(0,210,255,0.2); border-top-color: #00d2ff; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; margin: 0 auto 15px; }
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
.save-btn, .delete-btn { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.2); border: 1px solid #4CAF50; color: #4CAF50; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }
.delete-btn { background: rgba(244,67,54,0.2); border-color: #F44336; color: #F44336; }
.save-btn.saved { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.4); color: #4CAF50; cursor: default; }
.pattern-item { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 6px; margin: 4px 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 4px; }
.export-btn { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.2); border: 1px solid #4CAF50; color: #4CAF50; padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; width: 100%; font-weight: bold; }
.export-btn:hover { background: rgba(76,175,80,0.3); }
.confidence-bar { width: 100%; height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px 0; overflow: hidden; }
.confidence-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F44336 0%, #FF9800 50%, #4CAF50 100%); transition: width 0.5s; }
.hidden { display: none !important; }
.sliders-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px; }
@media (max-width: 600px) { .sliders-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.sliders-grid .crit { margin: 0; padding: 10px; }
.weights-info-box { background: rgba(33,150,243,0.1); border: 1px solid #2196F3; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 12px; }
.weights-info-box h4 { color: #64B5F6; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
.weights-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4px; color: #ccc; }
@media (max-width: 600px) { .weights-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.security-box { background: rgba(244,67,54,0.08); border: 2px solid #F44336; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 15px 0; display: none; }
.security-box h4 { color: #F44336; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
.security-finding { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; }
.security-finding.critical { border-left-color: #F44336; }
.security-finding.high { border-left-color: #ff9800; }
.security-finding.medium { border-left-color: #FFC107; }
.security-finding.low { border-left-color: #4CAF50; }
.security-finding-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.security-finding-field { font-size: 12px; color: #ccc; margin: 3px 0; }
.security-finding-field strong { color: #fff; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>&#129442; Pattern AI <span class="version-badge">v15.0</span></h1>

<div class="api-settings">
  <h4 onclick="toggleApiSettings()">&#9881;&#65039; Настройки</h4>
  <div id="api-settings-content" class="hidden">
    <div class="api-input-group">
      <label>&#128279;</label>
      <input type="text" id="proxy-input" placeholder="https://corsproxy.io/?" onchange="saveProxy()">
    </div>
    <div class="proxy-presets">
      <span class="proxy-preset" onclick="setProxy('https://corsproxy.io/?')">corsproxy.io</span>
      <span class="proxy-preset" onclick="setProxy('https://api.allorigins.win/raw?url=')">allorigins</span>
      <span class="proxy-preset" onclick="setProxy('')">Прямой</span>
    </div>
    <div class="api-status" id="proxy-status">Не настроен</div>
    <div class="api-input-group" style="margin-top:10px;">
      <label>&#9881;&#65039;</label>
      <select id="api-provider" onchange="switchAPIProvider()">
        <option value="groq" selected>Groq</option>
        <option value="hf">Hugging Face</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="api-input-group" id="groq-key-group">
      <label>&#128273;</label>
      <input type="password" id="groq-key-input" placeholder="gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx" onchange="saveGroqKey()">
    </div>
    <div class="api-status" id="groq-status">Не подключено</div>
    <div class="api-input-group" id="hf-key-group" style="display:none;">
      <label>&#128273;</label>
      <input type="password" id="hf-key-input" placeholder="hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx" onchange="saveHFKey()">
    </div>
    <div class="api-status" id="hf-status">Не подключено</div>
    <div class="api-input-group" style="margin-top:10px;">
      <label>&#129302;</label>
      <select id="model-select" onchange="saveModelChoice()"></select>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-blue btn-small" onclick="loadModels()" style="margin-left:34px; width:calc(100% - 34px);">&#128260; Обновить модели</button>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:10px; margin-left:34px;">
      <button class="btn btn-blue btn-small" onclick="testProxy()" style="flex:1;">&#128279; Тест прокси</button>
      <button class="btn btn-orange btn-small" onclick="testLLMConnection()" style="flex:1;">&#129514; Тест LLM</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mode-switch">
  <button class="mode-btn active" id="mode-system-btn" onclick="switchMode('system')">&#127760; Системы</button>
  <button class="mode-btn" id="mode-factcheck-btn" onclick="switchMode('factcheck')">&#128737;&#65039; Фейки</button>
  <button class="mode-btn" id="mode-resume-btn" onclick="switchMode('resume')">&#128084; Резюме</button>
</div>

<div class="domain-badge" id="domain-badge">&#127760; Режим: Системы <span class="llm-badge" id="llm-status-badge">LLM: готов</span></div>

<div class="query-box">
  <div id="resume-fields" class="hidden">
    <div class="api-input-group">
      <label>&#128188;</label>
      <textarea id="job-description" placeholder="Описание вакансии (опционально)..." style="min-height:60px;"></textarea>
    </div>
  </div>
  <textarea id="query" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Введите текст для анализа..." oninput="updateCharCount()"></textarea>
  <div class="char-counter" id="char-counter">0 / 2000</div>
  <button class="btn btn-green" onclick="analyzeText()">&#128269; Полный анализ с дебатами</button>
  <div class="status" id="local-status">Готов к работе</div>
  <div id="sliders-container" class="sliders-grid"></div>
  <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:10px;">
    <button class="btn btn-blue btn-small" id="reset-weights-btn" onclick="resetWeights()">&#128260; Сброс весов</button>
  </div>
  <div id="weights-info" class="weights-info-box hidden">
    <h4>&#128202; Автоматические веса критериев</h4>
    <div class="weights-list" id="weights-list"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="examples" id="examples-system">
    <h4>&#128221; Примеры</h4>
    <span class="example-btn real" onclick="loadExample('real_quantum')">&#9883; Квантовая</span>
    <span class="example-btn real" onclick="loadExample('real_crispr')">&#129516; CRISPR</span>
    <span class="example-btn real" onclick="loadExample('real_business')">&#128188; Lean</span>
    <span class="example-btn security" onclick="loadExample('security_api')">&#128275; API Security</span>
    <span class="example-btn security" onclick="loadExample('security_arch')">&#127959; Архитектура</span>
    <span class="example-btn security" onclick="loadExample('security_kyc')">&#128279; Интеграция</span>
    <span class="example-btn security" onclick="loadExample('security_breakglass')">&#128273; Break-glass</span>
  </div>
  <div class="examples hidden" id="examples-fake">
    <h4>&#128308; Примеры</h4>
    <span class="example-btn fake" onclick="loadExample('dudna')">&#129516; Дудна</span>
    <span class="example-btn fake" onclick="loadExample('okapi')">&#128737;&#65039; Окапи</span>
    <span class="example-btn fake" onclick="loadExample('quantum_fake')">&#128164; Сон</span>
  </div>
  <div class="examples hidden" id="examples-resume">
    <h4>&#128084; Примеры</h4>
    <span class="example-btn real" onclick="loadExample('resume_good')">&#9989; Хорошее</span>
    <span class="example-btn fake" onclick="loadExample('resume_fake')">&#127917; Приукрашенное</span>
    <span class="example-btn fake" onclick="loadExample('resume_ai')">&#129302; AI-шаблон</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="app"></div>

<div class="warning-box" id="warning-box"><h3>&#9888;&#65039; ВЫДУМАННЫЕ ФАКТЫ</h3><p id="warning-count"></p><ul id="warning-list"></ul></div>
<div class="contradiction-box" id="contradiction-box"><h3>&#128260; ПРОТИВОРЕЧИЕ</h3><p id="contradiction-text"></p></div>
<div class="fluff-box" id="fluff-box"><h3>&#128168; МАНИПУЛЯЦИЯ</h3><p id="fluff-text"></p></div>
<div class="concreteness-box" id="concreteness-box">
  <h4>&#128202; Анализ стиля и доказательной базы</h4>
  <div id="concreteness-content"></div>
</div>
<div class="meta-patterns-box" id="meta-patterns-box"><h4>&#128279; Мета-паттерны</h4><div id="meta-patterns-list"></div></div>
<div class="debate-box" id="debate-box">
  <h4>&#9878;&#65039; LLM-Дебаты</h4>
  <div id="debate-content"></div>
  <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#888;">Уверенность: <strong id="debate-confidence">-</strong></div>
  <div class="confidence-bar"><div class="confidence-fill" id="debate-confidence-bar" style="width:50%"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="questions-box" id="questions-box"><h4>&#127919; Вопросы для верификации</h4><div id="questions-content"></div></div>
<div class="security-box" id="security-box">
  <h4>&#128737;&#65039; АУДИТ ИНФОРМАЦИОННОЙ БЕЗОПАСНОСТИ</h4>
  <div id="security-content"></div>
</div>
<div class="memory-box" id="memory-box">
  <h4>&#128190; Библиотека 
    <button class="save-btn" onclick="exportPatternsDB()">&#128229;</button>
    <button class="save-btn" onclick="document.getElementById('import-file').click()">&#128228;</button>
    <input type="file" id="import-file" style="display:none" accept=".json" onchange="importPatternsDB(this)">
  </h4>
  <div class="memory-section">
    <div class="memory-label">Паттерны (<span id="memory-count">0</span>):</div>
    <div class="memory-value" id="memory-list">Пуста</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wiki-box" id="wiki-box"><h4>&#128218; Wikipedia</h4><div class="wiki-section"><div class="wiki-label">Сущности:</div><div class="wiki-value" id="wiki-results">-</div></div></div>
<div class="llm-analysis-box" id="llm-analysis-box">
  <h4>&#129504; Семантический анализ</h4>
